<code>assert !this.empty() => \result == this.get(this.size() - 1);</code>

This assert statement checks that if the stack is not empty, the result of the `peek` method is equal to the last item in the stack. Since the `peek` method already handles the case where the stack is empty by throwing an exception, we only need to specify the behavior when the stack is not empty.
